  "historyNote": "#5609, eff 4-6-93, EXPIRED: 4-6-99 New. #7716, INTERIM, eff 6-22-02, EXPIRED: 12-19-02 New. #7917, eff 7-11-03; ss by #8719, eff 11-1-06; ss by #8930, eff 7-4-07; ss by #9674, eff 4-2-10; ss by #12507, INTERIM, eff 4-2-18, EXPIRED: 10-1-18 New. #12634, eff 10-2-18",
